{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# SU(3) L = 2 — scan of the zero-twist norm formula over pairs of site representations\n\nTests only the **untwisted-limit formula** (no twisted FSoV determinant), for site 1 and site 2 each in\n$\\{[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[2,0,0],[3,0,0],[2,1,0],[3,1,0],[2,2,0]\\}$ (49 ordered pairs):\n$$\n\\lim_{\\varepsilon\\to0}\\frac{V_{\\lambda_{\\rm vac}}(z)}{V_{\\lambda_A}(z)}\\,\\frac{\\langle L_A|R_A\\rangle}{\\langle L_A|0\\rangle\\langle0|R_A\\rangle}=\\frac{\\mathcal B_A}{\\mathcal B_{\\rm vac}},\\qquad \\mathcal B_A=E_{\\lambda_A}\\frac{\\det\\mathcal N^A}{c^{\\rm ref}_A\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_A}\n$$\nwith the general rules of `SU3_ZeroTwist_Formula.tex`:\n- poles $\\theta_s+\\{\\lambda^{(s)}_3,\\dots,\\lambda^{(s)}_1\\}$, bracket $\\langle f\\rangle=\\oint\\frac{du}{2\\pi i}M e^{2\\pi iu}f$;\n- $c=(\\lambda^{(1)}_1-\\lambda^{(1)}_3)+(\\lambda^{(2)}_1-\\lambda^{(2)}_3)+1$;\n- $E_\\lambda=-\\frac{(\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2+1)(\\lambda_2-\\lambda_3+1)}{(\\lambda_1-\\lambda_3+1)!(\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2)!(\\lambda_2-\\lambda_3)!}$, rows $(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)$, L=1 forms of $\\Psi^{\\rm ref}$, $c^{\\rm ref}$.\n\n**Left side:** twisted eigenvectors in the highest-weight sectors only, branch-I product reference states ($a_{13}=3/5$, $a_{23}=4/7$), $\\langle L_A|R_A\\rangle=1$, quadratic extrapolation from $\\varepsilon=10^{-6},10^{-7},10^{-8}$, normalized by the vacuum.\n**Also recorded:** $c$ derived independently from the zero-twist $\\Delta T_2$ relation where it is determined; residuals with $c\\pm1$; the $E_A/E_{\\rm vac}$ the limit requires.\n\nChain point $\\theta=(1/3,-8/57)$, $h=1$, 200 digits. Symbols carry the suffix `S`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Rep-independent machinery: GT generators, L=2 chain for arbitrary site reps, Baxter operators, references. ---- *)\nClearAll[showS, thetaS, precS, rep1S, rep2S, ds1S, ds2S, dcS, E1S, E2S, EtotS, wtS, TmonS, qminorAtS, qcoS, setupChainS, TcoS,\n  nuS, qdetS, BaxDirS, BaxDualS, qpolyS, polyKernelS, nilExpS, refBraS, refKetS, rhoS, u];\n\nshowS[e_] := StringReplace[ToString[e, InputForm], {\"{\" -> \"(\", \"}\" -> \")\"}];\n\n(* GT machinery: identical to the other notebooks (memoized per rep). *)\nps[rr_] := ps[rr] = Block[{res = Prepend[rr, #] & /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rr[[1, i + 1]], rr[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rr[[1]]] - 1}]]},\n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rr_] := dim[rr] = Length[ps[{rr}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rr_] := JJ[k, l, rr] = Which[\n    k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rr}]],\n    l == k + 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l == k - 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rr].JJ[k + 1, l, rr] - JJ[k + 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k + 1, rr],\n    l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rr].JJ[k - 1, l, rr] - JJ[k - 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k - 1, rr]];\n\nthetaS = {1/3, -8/57};\nprecS = 200;\n\nTmonS[i_, j_][x_] := Sum[\n   ((x - thetaS[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dcS, SparseArray] - E1S[k, i]).\n    ((x - thetaS[[2]]) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dcS, SparseArray] - E2S[j, k]), {k, 3}];\nqminorAtS[II_, x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TmonS[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1)], {k, Length[II]}],\n   {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\n(* Sets all per-pair globals: generators, quantum-minor coefficients (exact interpolation), weights. *)\nsetupChainS[r1_, r2_] := Module[{id1, id2},\n   rep1S = r1; rep2S = r2; ds1S = dim[r1]; ds2S = dim[r2]; dcS = ds1S ds2S;\n   id1 = IdentityMatrix[ds1S, SparseArray]; id2 = IdentityMatrix[ds2S, SparseArray];\n   Clear[E1S, E2S, EtotS, qcoS];\n   Do[E1S[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[JJ[i, j, r1]], id2];\n    E2S[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[id1, SparseArray[JJ[i, j, r2]]];\n    EtotS[i, j] = E1S[i, j] + E2S[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n   Do[With[{d = 2 Length[II]},\n     With[{vals = Table[qminorAtS[II, n], {n, 1, d + 1}], vinv = Inverse[Table[n^k, {n, 1, d + 1}, {k, 0, d}]]},\n      Do[qcoS[II, k] = SparseArray[Sum[vinv[[k + 1, n]] vals[[n]], {n, 1, d + 1}]], {k, 0, d}]]],\n    {II, Join @@ (Subsets[Range[3], {#}] & /@ Range[3])}];\n   wtS = Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Normal@EtotS[i, i]], {i, 3}]];];\nTcoS[a_, k_, z_List] := Sum[(Times @@ z[[II]]) qcoS[II, k], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n\nnuS[i_][x_] := (x - thetaS[[1]] - rep1S[[i]]) (x - thetaS[[2]] - rep2S[[i]]);\nqdetS[x_] := nuS[1][x - 2] nuS[2][x - 1] nuS[3][x];\n\n(* Untwisted (z = 1) reduced Baxter operators: direct gauge nu1, dual gauge nu3. *)\nBaxDirS[T1_, T2_][q_][x_] := (nuS[1][x] nuS[1][x - 1] nuS[1][x - 2] q[x + 1] - (T1 /. u -> x) nuS[1][x - 1] nuS[1][x - 2] q[x]\n    + (T2 /. u -> x) nuS[1][x - 2] q[x - 1] - qdetS[x] q[x - 2]);\nBaxDualS[T1_, T2_][g_][x_] := (nuS[3][x + 1] nuS[3][x + 2] nuS[3][x + 3] g[x] - (T1 /. u -> x + 1) nuS[3][x + 2] nuS[3][x + 3] g[x + 1]\n    + (T2 /. u -> x + 2) nuS[3][x + 3] g[x + 2] - qdetS[x + 3] g[x + 3]);\nqpolyS[cl_List, y_] := Fold[#1 y + #2 &, 0, Reverse[cl]];\npolyKernelS[op_] := Module[{c, x, pf, eqs, ns, rr},\n   pf = Function[y, Evaluate[Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, 14}]]];\n   eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[op[pf][x]], x];\n   ns = NullSpace[Table[D[e, c[m]], {e, eqs}, {m, 0, 14}]];\n   rr = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Reverse /@ ns], {0 ..}];\n   SortBy[Table[RootReduce /@ (Reverse[r] /. {a___, 0 ..} :> {a}), {r, rr}], Length]];\n\n(* One-site branch-I reference covector/vector (a13 = 3/5, a23 = 4/7) for site rep r. *)\nnilExpS[mat_, c_] := Module[{acc = IdentityMatrix[Length[mat]], term = IdentityMatrix[Length[mat]]},\n   Do[term = c term.mat/k; acc += term, {k, 1, 8}]; acc];\nrefBraS[r_, z_] := With[{a12 = -z[[2]] (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(z[[1]] (z[[2]] - z[[3]])) (3/5)/(4/7), n = dim[r]},\n   UnitVector[n, 1].nilExpS[JJ[1, 2, r], a12].nilExpS[JJ[1, 3, r], 3/5].nilExpS[JJ[2, 3, r], 4/7]];\nrefKetS[r_, z_] := With[{a12 = -z[[2]] (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(z[[1]] (z[[2]] - z[[3]])) (3/5)/(4/7), a13 = 3/5, a23 = 4/7, n = dim[r]},\n   nilExpS[JJ[2, 1, r], -z[[1]] (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(a12 z[[2]] (z[[2]] - z[[3]]))].\n    nilExpS[JJ[3, 1, r], -z[[1]]^2/(a13 z[[3]]^2)].\n    nilExpS[JJ[3, 2, r], -z[[2]]^2 (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(a23 (z[[1]] - z[[2]]) z[[3]]^2)].UnitVector[n, 1]];\nrhoS[a_, k_] := Prime[7 a + k + 1]/(11 + 2 a + k);\n\n(* Sanity: GT basis vector 1 is the highest-weight vector of every rep in the scan. *)\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{Row[r, \",\"], dim[r], Diagonal[JJ[1, 1, r]][[1]] == r[[1]] && Diagonal[JJ[2, 2, r]][[1]] == r[[2]] &&\n     Max[Abs[JJ[1, 2, r][[All, 1]]]] == 0 && Max[Abs[JJ[2, 3, r][[All, 1]]]] == 0},\n    {r, {{1, 0, 0}, {1, 1, 0}, {2, 0, 0}, {3, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 0}}}],\n   {\"rep\", \"dim\", \"basis vector 1 is hw\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"752601\" data-output-id=\"66\" data-out-n=\"716\" data-sub-idx=\"30\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"73\" data-sub-end=\"76\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[716]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.64em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">basis vector 1 is hw</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
