   "value": "## Scan result ($\\theta=(1/3,-8/57)$, $t=\\theta_1-\\theta_2=9/19$)\n\n$\\log_{10}\\max_A|\\text{rhs}/\\text{lhs}-1|$; rows = site 1, columns = site 2; **Z** = $c^{\\rm ref}\\Psi^{\\rm ref}=0$ for some hw state (formula undefined).\n\n| site 1 \\\\ site 2 | [1,0,0] | [1,1,0] | [2,0,0] | [3,0,0] | [2,1,0] | [3,1,0] | [2,2,0] |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **[1,0,0]** | **−22** | 0 | 4 | 3 | 1 | 1 | Z |\n| **[1,1,0]** | 0 | **−20** | 0 | 1 | **−19** | **−19** | Z |\n| **[2,0,0]** | 1 | 0 | 2 | 5 | 4 | 1 | Z |\n| **[3,0,0]** | 1 | 0 | 3 | 4 | 2 | 3 | Z |\n| **[2,1,0]** | 1 | **−20** | 1 | 1 | **−19** | **−19** | Z |\n| **[3,1,0]** | 2 | **−20** | 2 | 1 | **−19** | **−17** | Z |\n| **[2,2,0]** | Z | Z | Z | Z | Z | Z | Z |\n\n- **Passes (10 pairs):** $[1,0,0]^{\\otimes2}$, and every pair with both sites in $\\{[1,1,0],[2,1,0],[3,1,0]\\}$, i.e. $\\lambda_2=1$ at both sites.\n- **Fails:** any pair with a $[2,0,0]$ or $[3,0,0]$ site, or one $[1,0,0]$ site together with a $\\lambda_2=1$ site. **Undefined:** any pair with a $[2,2,0]$ site ($c^{\\rm ref}\\Psi^{\\rm ref}$ vanishes).\n- **Unaffected by the failures:** the structural checks (quantum determinant, staggered Q degrees, one hw-limit twisted state per multiplet) pass for all 49 pairs, and wherever the zero-twist $\\Delta T_2$ relation determines $c$ it agrees with the rule $c=(\\lambda^{(1)}_1-\\lambda^{(1)}_3)+(\\lambda^{(2)}_1-\\lambda^{(2)}_3)+1$.\n- **The mismatch is a $t$-dependent rational factor**, not a wrong constant $E_\\lambda$. Required/formula ratio of $E_A/E_{\\rm vac}$, rationalized at $t=9/19$:\n  - $[2,0,0]^2$: $(3,1,0)\\to t^4/(4-t^2)^2$, $(2,2,0)\\to(1-t^2)^2/(4-t^2)^2$;\n  - $[1,0,0]\\otimes[2,1,0]$: $(2,2,0)\\to t^2/(2-t)^2$; swapped sites: $t^2/(2+t)^2$;\n  - $[1,0,0]\\otimes[2,0,0]$: $(1-2t)^2/(4(2-t)^2)$; swapped: $(1+2t)^2/(4(2+t)^2)$;\n  - $[1,0,0]\\otimes[1,1,0]$: $(1,1,1)\\to-104011/5600$ (not a square).\n  These are consistent readings of single rationals at one $t$, not fits. They point to a missing site-rep-dependent normalization with poles at $t=\\pm2$, most likely in $\\Psi^{\\rm ref}$, $c^{\\rm ref}$ (L=1 forms derived for $\\lambda_2=1$) or in the reference states.\n\n**Status:** the formula as written is validated only for $\\lambda_2=1$ at both sites (plus $[1,0,0]^2$). Not diagnosed further.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Rescan with the reference factors derived at L=1 (SU3_L1_GeneralRep_Normalization.wb), per site s:\n   Psi^ref = prod_s Q_1(th_s + l2^(s)) [Q_1(th_s) Q_2(th_s - 1) - Q_2(th_s) Q_1(th_s - 1)],\n   c^ref   = prod_s Q^3(th_s) [Q^3(th_s) Q^2(th_s + l2^(s) + 1) - Q^2(th_s) Q^3(th_s + l2^(s) + 1)]   (single term).\n   The physical limits are reused from section 3 (scanS); only the untwisted side is rebuilt. Same c rule, measure and E_lambda. ---- *)\nClearAll[BnewS, rescanPairS, rescanS, rescanProgressS, passNewS, rescanRowS];\n\nBnewS[m_, c_] := Module[{q, qd, Nm, lam2 = {rep1S[[2]], rep2S[[2]]}, psi, cref},\n   q = Function[{i, x}, qpolyS[N[untwS[[m, \"q\"]][[i]], 250], x]];\n   qd = Function[{j, x}, qpolyS[N[untwS[[m, \"qd\"]][[j]], 250], x]];\n   Nm = Table[{\n      bracketS[Function[x, qd[ij[[2]], x + 1] q[ij[[1]], x] - qd[ij[[2]], x] q[ij[[1]], x]]],\n      bracketS[Function[x, x qd[ij[[2]], x] q[ij[[1]], x - 1] - (x - c) qd[ij[[2]], x + 1] q[ij[[1]], x]]],\n      bracketS[Function[x, qd[ij[[2]], x] q[ij[[1]], x - 1] - qd[ij[[2]], x + 1] q[ij[[1]], x]]]}, {ij, {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}}];\n   psi = Product[With[{th = thetaS[[s]], l2 = lam2[[s]]}, q[1, th + l2] (q[1, th] q[2, th - 1] - q[2, th] q[1, th - 1])], {s, 2}];\n   cref = Product[With[{th = thetaS[[s]], l2 = lam2[[s]]}, qd[3, th] (qd[3, th] qd[2, th + l2 + 1] - qd[2, th] qd[3, th + l2 + 1])], {s, 2}];\n   {Det[Nm]/(cref psi), Det[Nm], cref psi}];\n\nrescanPairS[old_] := Module[{r1 = old[\"pair\"][[1]], r2 = old[\"pair\"][[2]], c, nhw, b, bm, bp, states},\n   setupChainS[r1, r2];\n   hwOpS = Normal[Join[EtotS[1, 2], EtotS[2, 3]]];\n   untwS = buildUntwS[];\n   setPolesS[];\n   c = cRuleS[r1, r2]; nhw = Length[untwS];\n   b = Table[BnewS[m, c], {m, nhw}]; bm = Table[BnewS[m, c - 1], {m, nhw}]; bp = Table[BnewS[m, c + 1], {m, nhw}];\n   states = Table[Module[{lhs = old[\"states\"][[m, \"lhs\"]], ratE = EformulaS[untwS[[m, \"mu\"]]]/EformulaS[untwS[[1, \"mu\"]]]},\n      <|\"mu\" -> untwS[[m, \"mu\"]], \"muOld\" -> old[\"states\"][[m, \"mu\"]], \"lhs\" -> lhs,\n       \"res\" -> Abs[ratE b[[m, 1]]/b[[1, 1]]/lhs - 1],\n       \"resMinus\" -> Abs[ratE bm[[m, 1]]/bm[[1, 1]]/lhs - 1], \"resPlus\" -> Abs[ratE bp[[m, 1]]/bp[[1, 1]]/lhs - 1],\n       \"Eformula\" -> ratE, \"Erequired\" -> lhs b[[1, 1]]/b[[m, 1]], \"cPsi\" -> Abs[b[[m, 3]]]|>], {m, nhw}];\n   <|\"pair\" -> {r1, r2}, \"nhw\" -> nhw, \"orderOK\" -> (states[[All, \"mu\"]] === states[[All, \"muOld\"]]), \"states\" -> states,\n    \"maxRes\" -> Max[states[[2 ;;, \"res\"]]],\n    \"contrast\" -> Min[Max[states[[2 ;;, \"resMinus\"]]], Max[states[[2 ;;, \"resPlus\"]]]],\n    \"minCPsi\" -> Min[states[[All, \"cPsi\"]]]|>];\n\nrescanS = Table[rescanProgressS = old[\"pair\"]; rescanPairS[old], {old, scanS}];\n\npassNewS[r_] := TrueQ[r[\"orderOK\"] && r[\"maxRes\"] < 10^-10 && r[\"contrast\"] > 10^-3];\nrescanRowS[r_] := {Row[r[\"pair\"][[1]], \",\"], Row[r[\"pair\"][[2]], \",\"], r[\"nhw\"], r[\"orderOK\"],\n   If[NumericQ[r[\"maxRes\"]], N[r[\"maxRes\"], 3], r[\"maxRes\"]], If[NumericQ[r[\"contrast\"]], N[r[\"contrast\"], 3], r[\"contrast\"]],\n   N[r[\"minCPsi\"], 3], If[passNewS[r], \"PASS\", Style[\"FAIL\", Red]]};\n\nColumn[{\n  Grid[{{\"pairs\", Length[rescanS]}, {\"pass\", Count[rescanS, _?passNewS]},\n    {\"worst residual\", N[Max[Select[rescanS[[All, \"maxRes\"]], NumericQ]], 3]},\n    {\"weakest c+-1 contrast\", N[Min[Select[rescanS[[All, \"contrast\"]], NumericQ]], 3]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Prepend[rescanRowS /@ rescanS, {\"site 1\", \"site 2\", \"# hw\", \"hw order = section 3\", \"max |rhs/lhs - 1|\", \"c+-1 contrast\",\n     \"min |c^ref Psi^ref|\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"752601\" data-output-id=\"72\" data-out-n=\"829\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"41\" data-sub-end=\"46\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[829]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"10\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:64.88em;vertical-align:-32.19em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:32.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-62.29em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:32.29em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pairs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pass</span></span></span>