  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. Consequences for the normalization. With W12 = -(mu1-mu2+1) q^3 F12 and W = (mu2-mu3+1) q_1 F (section 7):\n   Psi_0 = prod_s q_1(th_s+l2) W12(th_s+l3)  ~  -(mu1-mu2+1) prod_s q_1(th_s+l2) q^3(th_s+l3)      [per site; F12(th_s+l3) state-independent]\n   Psibar_0: q^3(x)q^2(x+m) - q^2(x)q^3(x+m) telescopes into W(x+k)'s; W(th_s+k) = 0 for l3 <= k < l2 leaves only k = l2, so\n   Psibar_0 = prod_s q^3(th_s+l3)^2 W(th_s+l2)/q^3(th_s+l2)  ~  (mu2-mu3+1) prod_s q^3(th_s+l3)^2 q_1(th_s+l2)/q^3(th_s+l2).\n   Two sites square the (mu+1) factors; with E_mu this gives, up to a state-independent constant,\n   E_mu/(Psibar_0 Psi_0)  ~  prod_s q^3(th_s+l2) / [ (mu1-mu3+1)! (mu1-mu2+1)! (mu2-mu3+1)! prod_s q_1(th_s+l2)^2 q^3(th_s+l3)^3 ].\n   Check: the ratio of the two normalizations is the same for every hw state (numeric, 250 digits). ---- *)\nClearAll[simpNormS, simpCheckS, simpTabS];\n(* {E_mu/(Psibar_0 Psi_0) as in section 6, simplified form} for hw state m of the current pair. *)\nsimpNormS[m_] := Module[{q, qd, l2 = {rep1S[[2]], rep2S[[2]]}, l3 = {rep1S[[3]], rep2S[[3]]}, mu = untwS[[m, \"mu\"]], psi, cref, simp},\n   q = Function[{i, x}, qpolyS[N[untwS[[m, \"q\"]][[i]], 250], x]];\n   qd = Function[{j, x}, qpolyS[N[untwS[[m, \"qd\"]][[j]], 250], x]];\n   psi = Product[With[{th = thetaS[[s]], a = l2[[s]], b = l3[[s]]}, q[1, th + a] (q[1, th + b] q[2, th + b - 1] - q[2, th + b] q[1, th + b - 1])], {s, 2}];\n   cref = Product[With[{th = thetaS[[s]], a = l2[[s]], b = l3[[s]]}, qd[3, th + b] (qd[3, th + b] qd[2, th + a + 1] - qd[2, th + b] qd[3, th + a + 1])], {s, 2}];\n   simp = Product[With[{th = thetaS[[s]], a = l2[[s]], b = l3[[s]]}, qd[3, th + a]/(q[1, th + a]^2 qd[3, th + b]^3)], {s, 2}]/\n     ((mu[[1]] - mu[[3]] + 1)! (mu[[1]] - mu[[2]] + 1)! (mu[[2]] - mu[[3]] + 1)!);\n   {EformulaS[mu]/(cref psi), simp}];\nsimpCheckS[pr_] := (setupChainS @@ pr; hwOpS = Normal[Join[EtotS[1, 2], EtotS[2, 3]]]; untwS = buildUntwS[];\n   With[{v = Table[With[{nn = simpNormS[m]}, nn[[1]]/nn[[2]]], {m, Length[untwS]}]},\n    {Row[pr[[1]], \",\"], Row[pr[[2]], \",\"], Length[untwS], N[Max[Abs[v/v[[1]] - 1]], 3]}]);\nsimpTabS = simpCheckS /@ {{{3, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 0}}, {{4, 1, 1}, {2, 0, 0}}, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}}, {{3, 0, 0}, {3, 3, 1}},\n    {{2, 2, 1}, {5, 3, 2}}, {{3, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}}, {{1, 0, 0}, {1, 1, 0}}, {{2, 2, 0}, {2, 2, 0}}};\nGrid[Prepend[simpTabS, {\"site 1\", \"site 2\", \"# hw\", \"max rel. spread of [E/(Psibar_0 Psi_0)] / simplified form\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
